      "source": "For an entity to be used in a parent child join relationship, it must have a property of type <code>JoinField</code> which must be annotated.\nLet’s assume a <code>Statement</code> entity where a statement may be a <em>question</em>, an <em>answer</em>, a <em>comment</em> or a <em>vote</em> (a <em>Builder</em> is also shown in this example, it’s not necessary, but later used in the sample code):",
      "translation": "若要使实体能够用于父子连接关系，它必须拥有一个类型为<code>JoinField</code>的属性，且该属性必须进行注解。\n假设有一个<code>Statement</code>实体，其中一条陈述可能是一个<em>问题</em>、一个<em>答案</em>、一个<em>评论</em>或一个<em>投票</em>（本示例中还展示了一个<em>构建器</em>，虽然它并非必需，但将在后续示例代码中使用）：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The following code shows as an example how to retrieve all entries that have a <em>vote</em> (which must be <em>answers</em>, because only answers can have a vote) using an <code>ElasticsearchOperations</code> instance:",
      "translation": "以下代码示例展示了如何使用 <code>ElasticsearchOperations</code> 实例检索所有包含 <em>vote</em>（必须是 <em>answers</em>，因为只有答案才有投票）的条目：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data Elasticsearch supports the <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/parent-join.html\">Join data type</a> for creating the corresponding index mappings and for storing the relevant information.",
      "translation": "Spring Data Elasticsearch 支持<a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/parent-join.html\">Join 数据类型</a>，用于创建相应的索引映射并存储相关信息。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Currently native queries must be used to query the data, so there is no support from standard repository methods. <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"../repositories/custom-implementations.html\">Custom Repository Implementations</a> can be used instead.",
      "translation": "目前必须使用原生查询来检索数据，因此标准仓储方法不提供支持。可以使用<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"../repositories/custom-implementations.html\">自定义仓储实现</a>作为替代方案。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data Elasticsearch will build the following mapping for this class:",
      "translation": "Spring Data Elasticsearch 将为该类构建以下映射：",
      "count": 1
    },
