    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>for routing related info see <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"routing.html\">Routing values</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>a question can have answers and comments</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"3\"></i><b>3</b></td>\n<td>an answer can have votes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"4\"></i><b>4</b></td>\n<td>the <code>JoinField</code> property is used to combine the name (<em>question</em>, <em>answer</em>, <em>comment</em> or <em>vote</em>) of the relation with the parent id.\nThe generic type must be the same as the <code>@Id</code> annotated property.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>有关路由的信息，请参阅<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"routing.html\">路由值</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>问题可以有答案和评论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"3\"></i><b>3</b></td>\n<td>答案可以包含投票</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"4\"></i><b>4</b></td>\n<td><code>JoinField</code>属性用于将关系名称（<em>question</em>、<em>answer</em>、<em>comment</em>或<em>vote</em>）与父 ID 组合。泛型类型必须与带有<code>@Id</code>注解的属性相同。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>create a question statement</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>the first answer to the question</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"3\"></i><b>3</b></td>\n<td>the second answer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"4\"></i><b>4</b></td>\n<td>a comment to the question</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"5\"></i><b>5</b></td>\n<td>a vote for the first answer, this needs to have the routing set to the weather document, see <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"routing.html\">Routing values</a>.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>创建问题陈述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>问题的第一个答案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"3\"></i><b>3</b></td>\n<td>第二个答案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"4\"></i><b>4</b></td>\n<td>对问题的评论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"5\"></i><b>5</b></td>\n<td>为第一个答案投票，此操作需要将路由设置为天气文档，请参阅 <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"routing.html\">路由值</a>。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
